{
  "version": 1,
  "_doc": "HOLDOUT evaluation corpus for the TV/web natural-language gallery command interpreter. Evaluated ONCE at the end; NOT used to tune the model or prompt. NO real names/user data. Ground-truth 'expect' labels the CORRECT interpretation. Relative dates authored against referenceNow = 2026-07-12T12:00:00Z. Conventions match the dev corpus: winter YYYY = Dec YYYY .. Feb YYYY+1; Christmas = Dec 24-26; bare month => current year. Person ambiguity is resolved server-side, so ambiguous-name cases only assert the extracted span. Emphasis: lowercase names, names that are also common nouns (Rosa/Neve/Aurora/Vera/Gioia/Celeste), AND/OR/exclusion, refine, ambiguous dates, metadata-vs-semantic, typos/colloquial, short, malformed.",
